{"version":2,"surah":77,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"77:1","arabic":" وَٱلْمُرْسَلَـٰتِ عُرْفًا","page":580,"juz":29,"en":"By those [winds] sent forth in gusts","id":"Demi (malaikat-malaikat) yang diutus untuk membawa kebaikan,","latinEn":"Walmursalati AAurfa","latinId":"Wal-mursalāti ‘urfā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَٱلْمُرْسَلَـٰتِ","en":"By the ones sent forth","id":"By the ones sent forth","t":"wal-mur'salāti"},{"a":"عُرْفًۭا","en":"one after another","id":"one after another","t":"ʿur'fan"}]},{"n":2,"key":"77:2","arabic":"فَٱلْعَـٰصِفَـٰتِ عَصْفًا","page":580,"juz":29,"en":"And the winds that blow violently","id":"dan (malaikat-malaikat) yang terbang dengan kencangnya,","latinEn":"FalAAasifati AAasfa","latinId":"Fal-‘āṣifāti ‘aṣfā(n).","words":[{"a":"فَٱلْعَـٰصِفَـٰتِ","en":"And the winds that blow","id":"And the winds that blow","t":"fal-ʿāṣifāti"},{"a":"عَصْفًۭا","en":"violently","id":"violently","t":"ʿaṣfan"}]},{"n":3,"key":"77:3","arabic":"وَٱلنَّـٰشِرَٰتِ نَشْرًا","page":580,"juz":29,"en":"And [by] the winds that spread [clouds]","id":"dan (malaikat-malaikat) yang menyebarkan (rahmat Allah) dengan seluas-luasnya,","latinEn":"Wannashirati nashra","latinId":"Wan-nāsyirāti nasyrā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَٱلنَّـٰشِرَٰتِ","en":"And the ones that scatter","id":"And the ones that scatter","t":"wal-nāshirāti"},{"a":"نَشْرًۭا","en":"far and wide","id":"far and wide","t":"nashran"}]},{"n":4,"key":"77:4","arabic":"فَٱلْفَـٰرِقَـٰتِ فَرْقًا","page":580,"juz":29,"en":"And those [angels] who bring criterion","id":"dan (malaikat-malaikat) yang membedakan (antara yang baik dan yang buruk) dengan sejelas-jelasnya,","latinEn":"Falfariqati farqa","latinId":"Fal-fāriqāti farqā(n).","words":[{"a":"فَٱلْفَـٰرِقَـٰتِ","en":"And those who separate","id":"And those who separate","t":"fal-fāriqāti"},{"a":"فَرْقًۭا","en":"(by the) Criterion","id":"(by the) Criterion","t":"farqan"}]},{"n":5,"key":"77:5","arabic":"فَٱلْمُلْقِيَـٰتِ ذِكْرًا","page":580,"juz":29,"en":"And those [angels] who deliver a 