:"(of) Judgment","id":"(of) Judgment","t":"l-faṣli"}]},{"n":14,"key":"77:14","arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا يَوْمُ ٱلْفَصْلِ","page":580,"juz":29,"en":"And what can make you know what is the Day of Judgement?","id":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah hari keputusan itu?","latinEn":"Wama adraka ma yawmualfasl","latinId":"Wa mā adrāka mā yaumul-faṣl(i).","words":[{"a":"وَمَآ","en":"And what","id":"And what","t":"wamā"},{"a":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","en":"will make you know","id":"will make you know","t":"adrāka"},{"a":"مَا","en":"what","id":"what","t":"mā"},{"a":"يَوْمُ","en":"(is the) Day","id":"(is the) Day","t":"yawmu"},{"a":"ٱلْفَصْلِ","en":"(of) the Judgment","id":"(of) the Judgment","t":"l-faṣli"}]},{"n":15,"key":"77:15","arabic":"وَيْلٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","page":580,"juz":29,"en":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","id":"Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi mereka yang mendustakan (kebenaran).","latinEn":"Waylun yawma-ithin lilmukaththibeen","latinId":"Wailuy yauma'iżil lil-mukażżibīn(a).","words":[{"a":"وَيْلٌۭ","en":"Woe","id":"Woe","t":"waylun"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en":"to the deniers","id":"to the deniers","t":"lil'mukadhibīna"}]},{"n":16,"key":"77:16","arabic":"أَلَمْ نُهْلِكِ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","page":580,"juz":29,"en":"Did We not destroy the former peoples?","id":"Bukankah telah Kami binasakan orang-orang yang dahulu?","latinEn":"Alam nuhliki al-awwaleen","latinId":"Alam nuhlikil-awwalīn(a).","words":[{"a":"أَلَمْ","en":"Did not","id":"Did not","t":"alam"},{"a":"نُهْلِكِ","en":"We destroy","id":"We destroy","t":"nuh'liki"},{"a":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en":"the former (people)","id":"the former (people)","t":"l-awalīna"}]},{"n":17,"key":"77:17","arabic":"ثُمَّ نُتْبِعُهُمُ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِينَ","page":580,"juz":29,"en":"Then We will follow them with the later ones.","id":"Lalu Kami susulkan (azab Kami terhadap) orang-orang yang datang kemudian.","latinEn":"Thumma nutbiAAuhumu al-akhireen","latinId":"Ṡumma nutbi‘uhumu