","arabic":"أَلَمْ نَجْعَلِ ٱلْأَرْضَ كِفَاتًا","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Have We not made the earth a container","id":"Bukankah Kami jadikan bumi untuk (tempat) berkumpul,","latinEn":"Alam najAAali al-arda kifata","latinId":"Alam naj‘alil-arḍa kifātā(n).","words":[{"a":"أَلَمْ","en":"Have not","id":"Have not","t":"alam"},{"a":"نَجْعَلِ","en":"We made","id":"We made","t":"najʿali"},{"a":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","en":"the earth","id":"the earth","t":"l-arḍa"},{"a":"كِفَاتًا","en":"a receptacle","id":"a receptacle","t":"kifātan"}]},{"n":26,"key":"77:26","arabic":"أَحْيَآءً وَأَمْوَٰتًا","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Of the living and the dead?","id":"bagi yang masih hidup dan yang sudah mati?","latinEn":"Ahyaan waamwata","latinId":"Aḥyā'aw wa amwātā(n).","words":[{"a":"أَحْيَآءًۭ","en":"(For the) living","id":"(For the) living","t":"aḥyāan"},{"a":"وَأَمْوَٰتًۭا","en":"and (the) dead","id":"and (the) dead","t":"wa-amwātan"}]},{"n":27,"key":"77:27","arabic":"وَجَعَلْنَا فِيهَا رَوَٰسِىَ شَـٰمِخَـٰتٍ وَأَسْقَيْنَـٰكُم مَّآءً فُرَاتًا","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"And We placed therein lofty, firmly set mountains and have given you to drink sweet water.","id":"Dan Kami jadikan padanya gunung-gunung yang tinggi, dan Kami beri minum kamu dengan air tawar?","latinEn":"WajaAAalna feeha rawasiyashamikhatin waasqaynakum maan furata","latinId":"Wa ja‘alnā fīhā rawāsiya syāmikhātiw wa asqainākum mā'an furātā(n).","words":[{"a":"وَجَعَلْنَا","en":"And We made","id":"And We made","t":"wajaʿalnā"},{"a":"فِيهَا","en":"therein","id":"therein","t":"fīhā"},{"a":"رَوَٰسِىَ","en":"firmly set mountains","id":"firmly set mountains","t":"rawāsiya"},{"a":"شَـٰمِخَـٰتٍۢ","en":"lofty","id":"lofty","t":"shāmikhātin"},{"a":"وَأَسْقَيْنَـٰكُم","en":"and We gave you to drink","id":"and We gave you to drink","t":"wa-asqaynākum"},{"a":"مَّآءًۭ","en":"water","id":"water","t":"māan"},{"a":"فُرَاتًۭا","en":"sweet","id":"sweet","t":"furātan"}]},{"n":28,"key":"77:28","arabic":"وَيْلٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","id":"Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi mereka yang mendustakan (kebenaran).","latinEn":"Waylun yawma-ithin lilmukaththibeen","latinId":"Wailuy yauma'iżil lil-mukażżibīn(a).","words":[{"a":"وَيْلٌۭ","en":"Woe","id":"Woe","t":"waylun"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en":"to the deniers","id":"to the deniers","t":"lil'mukadhibīna"}]},{"n":29,"key":"77:29","arabic":"ٱنطَلِقُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ مَا كُنتُم بِهِۦ تُكَذِّبُونَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"[They will be told], \"Proceed to that which you used to deny.","id":"(Akan dikatakan), \"Pergilah kamu guna mendapatkan apa (azab) yang dahulu kamu dustakan.","latinEn":"Intaliqoo ila ma kuntumbihi tukaththiboon","latinId":"Inṭaliqū ilā mā kuntum bihī tukażżibūn(a).","words":[{"a":"ٱنطَلِقُوٓا۟","en":"Proceed","id":"Proceed","t":"inṭaliqū"},{"a":"إِلَىٰ","en":"to","id":"to","t":"ilā"},{"a":"مَا","en":"what","id":"what","t":"mā"},{"a":"كُنتُم","en":"you used to","id":"you used to","t":"kuntum"},{"a":"بِهِۦ","en":"in it","id":"in it","t":"bihi"},{"a":"تُكَذِّبُونَ","en":"deny","id":"deny","t":"tukadhibūna"}]},{"n":30,"key":"77:30","arabic":"ٱنطَلِقُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ ظِلٍّ ذِى ثَلَـٰثِ شُعَبٍ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Proceed to a shadow [of smoke] having three columns.","id":"Pergilah kamu mendapatkan naungan (asap api neraka) yang mempunyai tiga cabang,","latinEn":"Intaliqoo ila thillinthee thalathi shuAAab","latinId":"Inṭaliqū ilā ẓillin żī ṡalāṡi syu‘ab(in).","words":[{"a":"ٱنطَلِقُوٓا۟","en":"Proceed","id":"Proceed","t":"inṭaliqū"},{"a":"إِلَىٰ","en":"to","id":"to","t":"ilā"},{"a":"ظِلٍّۢ","en":"a shadow","id":"a shadow","t":"ẓillin"},{"a":"ذِى","en":"having","id":"having","t":"dhī"},{"a":"ثَلَـٰثِ","en":"three","id":"three","t":"thalāthi"},{"a":"شُعَبٍۢ","en":"columns","id":"columns","t":"shuʿabin"}]},{"n":31,"key":"77:31","arabic":"لَّا ظَلِيلٍ وَلَا يُغْنِى مِنَ ٱللَّهَبِ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"[But having] no cool shade and availing not against the flame.\"","id":"yang tidak melindungi dan tidak pula menolak nyala api neraka.\"","latinEn":"La thaleelin walayughnee mina allahab","latinId":"Lā ẓalīliw wa lā yugnī minal-lahab(i).","words":[{"a":"لَّا","en":"No","id":"No","t":"lā"},{"a":"ظَلِيلٍۢ","en":"cool shade","id":"cool shade","t":"ẓalīlin"},{"a":"وَلَا","en":"and not","id":"and not","t":"walā"},{"a":"يُغْنِى","en":"availing","id":"availing","t":"yugh'nī"},{"a":"مِنَ","en":"against","id":"against","t":"mina"},{"a":"ٱللَّهَبِ","en":"the flame","id":"the flame","t":"l-lahabi"}]},{"n":32,"key":"77:32","arabic":"إِنَّهَا تَرْمِى بِشَرَرٍ كَٱلْقَصْرِ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Indeed, it throws sparks [as huge] as a fortress,","id":"Sungguh, (neraka) itu menyemburkan bunga api (sebesar dan setinggi) istana,","latinEn":"Innaha tarmee bishararin kalqasr","latinId":"Innahā tarmī bisyararin kal-qaṣr(i).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّهَا","en":"Indeed, it","id":"Indeed, it","t":"innahā"},{"a":"تَرْمِى","en":"throws up","id":"throws up","t":"tarmī"},{"a":"بِشَرَرٍۢ","en":"sparks","id":"sparks","t":"bishararin"},{"a":"كَٱلْقَصْرِ","en":"as the fortress","id":"as the fortress","t":"kal-qaṣri"}]},{"n":33,"key":"77:33","arabic":"كَأَنَّهُۥ جِمَـٰلَتٌ صُفْرٌ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"As if they were yellowish [black] camels.","id":"seakan-akan iring-iringan unta yang kuning.","latinEn":"Kaannahu jimalatun sufr","latinId":"Ka'annahū jimālatun ṣufr(un).","words":[{"a":"كَأَنَّهُۥ","en":"As if they (were)","id":"As if they (were)","t":"ka-annahu"},{"a":"جِمَـٰلَتٌۭ","en":"camels","id":"camels","t":"jimālatun"},{"a":"صُفْرٌۭ","en":"yellow","id":"yellow","t":"ṣuf'run"}]},{"n":34,"key":"77:34","arabic":"وَيْلٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","id":"Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi mereka yang mendustakan (kebenaran).","latinEn":"Waylun yawma-ithin lilmukaththibeen","latinId":"Wailuy yauma'iżil lil-mukażżibīn(a).","words":[{"a":"وَيْلٌۭ","en":"Woe","id":"Woe","t":"waylun"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en":"to the deniers","id":"to the deniers","t":"lil'mukadhibīna"}]},{"n":35,"key":"77:35","arabic":"هَـٰذَا يَوْمُ لَا يَنطِقُونَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"This is a Day they will not speak,","id":"Inilah hari, saat mereka tidak dapat berbicara,","latinEn":"Hatha yawmu la yantiqoon","latinId":"Hāżā yaumu lā yanṭiqūn(a).","words":[{"a":"هَـٰذَا","en":"This","id":"This","t":"hādhā"},{"a":"يَوْمُ","en":"(is) a Day","id":"(is) a Day","t":"yawmu"},{"a":"لَا","en":"not","id":"not","t":"lā"},{"a":"يَنطِقُونَ","en":"they will speak","id":"they will speak","t":"yanṭiqūna"}]},{"n":36,"key":"77:36","arabic":"وَلَا يُؤْذَنُ لَهُمْ فَيَعْتَذِرُونَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Nor will it be permitted for them to make an excuse.","id":"dan tidak diizinkan kepada mereka mengemukakan alasan agar mereka dimaafkan.","latinEn":"Wala yu/thanu lahum fayaAAtathiroon","latinId":"Wa lā yu'żanu lahum fa ya‘tażirūn(a).","words":[{"a":"وَلَا","en":"And not","id":"And not","t":"walā"},{"a":"يُؤْذَنُ","en":"will it be permitted","id":"will it be permitted","t":"yu'dhanu"},{"a":"لَهُمْ","en":"for them","id":"for them","t":"lahum"},{"a":"فَيَعْتَذِرُونَ","en":"to make excuses","id":"to make excuses","t":"fayaʿtadhirūna"}]},{"n":37,"key":"77:37","arabic":"وَيْلٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","id":"Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi mereka yang mendustakan (kebenaran).","latinEn":"Waylun yawma-ithin lilmukaththibeen","latinId":"Wailuy yauma'iżil lil-mukażżibīn(a).","words":[{"a":"وَيْلٌۭ","en":"Woe","id":"Woe","t":"waylun"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en":"to the deniers","id":"to the deniers","t":"lil'mukadhibīna"}]},{"n":38,"key":"77:38","arabic":"هَـٰذَا يَوْمُ ٱلْفَصْلِ ۖ جَمَعْنَـٰكُمْ وَٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"This is the Day of Judgement; We will have assembled you and the former peoples.","id":"Inilah hari keputusan; (pada hari ini) Kami kumpulkan kamu dan orang-orang yang terdahulu.","latinEn":"Hatha yawmu alfasli jamaAAnakumwal-awwaleen","latinId":"Hāżā yaumul-faṣli jama‘nākum wal-awwalīn(a).","words":[{"a":"هَـٰذَا","en":"This","id":"This","t":"hādhā"},{"a":"يَوْمُ","en":"(is the) Day","id":"(is the) Day","t":"yawmu"},{"a":"ٱلْفَصْلِ ۖ","en":"(of) Judgment","id":"(of) Judgment","t":"l-faṣli"},{"a":"جَمَعْنَـٰكُمْ","en":"We have gathered you","id":"We have gathered you","t":"jamaʿnākum"},{"a":"وَٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en":"and the former (people)","id":"and the former (people)","t":"wal-awalīna"}]},{"n":39,"key":"77:39","arabic":"فَإِن كَانَ لَكُمْ كَيْدٌ فَكِيدُونِ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"So if you have a plan, then plan against Me.","id":"Maka jika kamu punya tipu daya, maka lakukanlah (tipu daya) itu terhadap-Ku.","latinEn":"Fa-in kana lakum kaydun fakeedoon","latinId":"Fa'in kāna lakum kaidun fakīdūn(i).","words":[{"a":"فَإِن","en":"So if","id":"So if","t":"fa-in"},{"a":"كَانَ","en":"is","id":"is","t":"kāna"},{"a":"لَكُمْ","en":"for you","id":"for you","t":"lakum"},{"a":"كَيْدٌۭ","en":"a plan","id":"a plan","t":"kaydun"},{"a":"فَكِيدُونِ","en":"then plan against Me","id":"then plan against Me","t":"fakīdūni"}]},{"n":40,"key":"77:40","arabic":"وَيْلٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","id":"Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi mereka yang mendustakan (kebenaran).","latinEn":"Waylun yawma-ithin lilmukaththibeen","latinId":"Wailuy yauma'iżil lil-mukażżibīn(a).","words":[{"a":"وَيْلٌۭ","en":"Woe","id":"Woe","t":"waylun"},{"a":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","en":"that Day","id":"that Day","t":"yawma-idhin"},{"a":"لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en":"to the deniers","id":"to the deniers","t":"lil'mukadhibīna"}]},{"n":41,"key":"77:41","arabic":"إِنَّ ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ فِى ظِلَـٰلٍ وَعُيُونٍ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Indeed, the righteous will be among shades and springs","id":"Sungguh, orang-orang yang bertakwa berada dalam naungan (pepohonan surga yang teduh) dan (di sekitar) mata air,","latinEn":"Inna almuttaqeena fee thilalinwaAAuyoon","latinId":"Innal-muttaqīna fī ẓilāliw wa ‘uyūn(in).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّ","en":"Indeed","id":"Indeed","t":"inna"},{"a":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","en":"the righteous","id":"the righteous","t":"l-mutaqīna"},{"a":"فِى","en":"(will be) in","id":"(will be) in","t":"fī"},{"a":"ظِلَـٰلٍۢ","en":"shades","id":"shades","t":"ẓilālin"},{"a":"وَعُيُونٍۢ","en":"and springs","id":"and springs","t":"waʿuyūnin"}]},{"n":42,"key":"77:42","arabic":"وَفَوَٰكِهَ مِمَّا يَشْتَهُونَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"And fruits from whatever they desire,","id":"dan buah-buahan yang mereka sukai.","latinEn":"Wafawakiha mimma yashtahoon","latinId":"Wa fawākiha mimmā yasytahūn(a).","words":[{"a":"وَفَوَٰكِهَ","en":"And fruits","id":"And fruits","t":"wafawākiha"},{"a":"مِمَّا","en":"from what","id":"from what","t":"mimmā"},{"a":"يَشْتَهُونَ","en":"they desire","id":"they desire","t":"yashtahūna"}]},{"n":43,"key":"77:43","arabic":"كُلُوا۟ وَٱشْرَبُوا۟ هَنِيٓـًٔۢا بِمَا كُنتُمْ تَعْمَلُونَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"[Being told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you used to do.\"","id":"(Katakan kepada mereka), \"Makan dan minumlah dengan rasa nikmat sebagai balasan dari apa yang telah kamu kerjakan.\"","latinEn":"Kuloo washraboo hanee-an bimakuntum taAAmaloon","latinId":"Kulū wasyrabū hanī'am bimā kuntum ta‘malūn(a).","words":[{"a":"كُلُوا۟","en":"Eat","id":"Eat","t":"kulū"},{"a":"وَٱشْرَبُوا۟","en":"and drink","id":"and drink","t":"wa-ish'rabū"},{"a":"هَنِيٓـًٔۢا","en":"(in) satisfaction","id":"(in) satisfaction","t":"hanīan"},{"a":"بِمَا","en":"for what","id":"for what","t":"bimā"},{"a":"كُنتُمْ","en":"you used to","id":"you used to","t":"kuntum"},{"a":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en":"do","id":"do","t":"taʿmalūna"}]},{"n":44,"key":"77:44","arabic":"إِنَّا كَذَٰلِكَ نَجْزِى ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","page":581,"juz":29,"en":"Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good.","id":"Sunggu